  U~(sigma,theta,eps) = epsilon**5*sigma**9*sin(t) + epsilon**4 - 4*epsilon**3*sigma**3*cos(t)**2 + 6*epsilon**2*sigma**6*cos(t)**4 - 4*epsilon*sigma**9*cos(t)**6 + sigma**12*cos(t)**8 + sin(t)**2*cos(t)/2 + cos(t)
  тождество U(s omega + s^c eps n) = s^j U~(s^(1/N),theta,eps): True
