  U~(sigma,theta,eps) = epsilon**5*sigma**7*sin(t) + epsilon**4 - 8*epsilon*sin(t)**4 + 9*epsilon + sigma**2*cos(t)**6
  тождество U(s omega + s^c eps n) = s^j U~(s^(1/N),theta,eps): True
